    "text": "KXII.com\nwebsite\nSherman\nSherman asking residents to conserve water\nBy KXII Staff,\n2 hours agoSHERMAN, Texas (KXII) - The City of Sherman is asking residents to conserve water. The city said that it’s Lake Texoma Pump Station that supplies raw surface water to its water treatment plant is experiencing a power outage. The outage shut down the pumps, and as of Wednesday afternoon, crews were troubleshooting the problems.",
